{"id":"626200","name":"凉拌枸杞芽","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/626200/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"枸杞芽","amount":"一把"}],"sub":[{"name":"熟芝麻","amount":"少许"},{"name":"辣椒面","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"绿油油的枸杞芽。","img":"images/626200/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"采摘鲜嫩的枸杞芽，淘洗干净。","img":"images/626200/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"淖一下捞出，挤出多余水分。","img":"images/626200/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切小段。","img":"images/626200/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入盆中，加少许盐、醋和白糖，热油浇一下，拌匀即可。","img":"images/626200/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/626200/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"撒上少许白芝麻和辣椒面，更好看。","img":"images/626200/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"爽口又开胃，快手菜。","img":"images/626200/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}